--- A#2: Compliance rejection through the real live registerInvoice call ---
Script: app/scripts/campaign-01-compliance-reject.mts (deleted after use)
Signer: DCW
Result: PASS. A throwaway debtor address was added to a run-scoped denylist (never touches the
real denylist.json). registerInvoice() threw ComplianceRejectedError before any submission was
attempted -- no writeContract/DCW contract-execution call was ever made.
Real invoice id computed client-side (EIP-712 hash, same as invoiceAttestationId always returns):
  0xa9c723f31c7a0cd7c37647409e0b13e526d2f39920b193a61c6fd75a846d3efa
On-chain verification: `cast call registry getInvoice(bytes32) <id>` reverted with selector
0x20bb2818, confirmed via `cast sig "InvoiceNotFound(bytes32)"` to be exactly that error --
proof the invoice genuinely never landed on-chain, not just that the app-layer check fired.

