  wallet's Arc-testnet USDC balance: 46,723,066 -> 46,819,693 base units (+96,627, ~0.0966 USDC --
  same small forwarder-fee-split pattern as every prior Unified Balance proof).

  Both signer paths now appear across this one narrative, per the plan: DCW for register+settle+
